# Git excludes the SANDBOX IMAGE applies to every workspace repository it hosts, installed as the
# system-wide `core.excludesFile` by Dockerfile.sandbox. Anything listed here never enters a
# workspace snapshot, whichever `.gitignore` the workspace itself carries — so a platform-owned
# file baked into the image is never overlaid by a restore, and a fix shipped in a new image
# reaches every app on its next launch. (The template's own `.gitignore` cannot do this job: it is
# tracked in the snapshot, so a restore of an older bundle brings back an older copy of it.)
#
# Do NOT list files the app's deploy pipeline needs from the snapshot (`backend/src/services/deploy`
# collects the bundle) — only files the platform bakes and serves itself.
/instrumentation-client.ts
